ion = \'C\'\nR2:VALUE &lt;= 2550 IF ALL @MaximumAuthorisedDimensionsDerogationIndicator = \'N\'\nR3:VALUE IS ABSENT IF ANY @LengthAdjustableMin IS PRESENT OR @LengthAdjustableMax IS PRESENT\nR4:VALUE IS ABSENT IF ALL @StageOfCompletion = \'I\'','N','0','admin','2026-06-05 10:06:21','',NULL,'当车型=Mx, N1, Lx 且 完成阶段=C（完整车）时必填\r\n当车型=N2x, N3x, Ox, Tx, Cx, Rx, Sx 且 LengthAdjustableMin / LengthAdjustableMax has no value 且 完成阶段=C（完整车）时必填\r\n\r\nWidth &lt;= 2550 where VehicleCategory = Mx 且 MaximumAuthorisedDimensionsDerogationIndicator = N\r\nWidth &lt;= 2600 where VehicleCategory = Nx, Ox 且 MaximumAuthorisedDimensionsDerogationIndicator = N\r\n\r\n当车型=Mx, Nx, Ox, Tx, Cx, Rx, Sx 且 完成阶段=I（不完整车）时禁止\r\n当 LengthAdjustableMin/LengthAdjustableMax 有值时禁止','min=0.0; max=9999.0','6. Width:…mm','STRIP_UNIT',34,'VALUE IS PRESENT IF','认证系统__0','07686d4d-be9a-5755-b648-f5518f6aeb98',NULL,NULL,'6.',NULL,'{\"COC模版_01\":\"Width:…mm\"}'),(5211,90,'MaximumPermissibleRearOverhang','Short','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1:VALUE IS PRESENT IF ALL @StageOfCompletion = \'I\'\nR2:VALUE IS ABSENT IF ALL @StageOfCompletion IN [\'C\',\'V\']','N','0','admin','2026-06-05 10:07:22','',NULL,'当车型=Mx, Nx, Ox  且 StageOf Completion = I时必填\r\n\r\n当车型=Mx, Nx, Ox  且 StageOf Completion = C, V时禁止\r\n当车型=Lx, Tx, Cx, Rx, Sx时禁止','min=0.0; max=9999.0',NULL,'NULL',34,'VALUE IS PRESENT IF',NULL,'23c17038-3774-553d-8c1d-476338c99aa1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(5213,85,'MaximumPermissibleWidth','Short','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1:VALUE IS PRESENT IF ALL @StageOfCompletion = \'I\'\nR2:VALUE IS ABSENT IF ALL @StageOfCompletion IN [\'C\',\'V\']\nR3:VALUE IS ABSENT IF ANY @MaximumPermissibleWidthMin IS PRESENT OR @MaximumPermissibleWidthMax IS PRESENT','N','0','admin','2026-06-05 10:09:33','',NULL,'当车型=Mx, Nx, Ox, 且 完成阶段=I（不完整车）时必填\r\n当车型=Tx, Cx, Rx, Sx  且 MaximumPermissibleWidthMin / MaximumPermissibleWidthMax has no value 且 完成阶段=I（不完整车） 时必填\r\n\r\n禁止 where VehicleCode = Lx\r\n当完成阶段=C, V时禁止\r\n当 MaximumPermissibleWidthMin / Max